      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} \n\nSince this implementation was reverted, there are currently no worlds using it.\n\nAdditionally, this behavior was something I tested in the Unity Editor while investigating the cause of heavy world performance, and it has not been verified whether VRChat’s runtime behaves the same way. As I mentioned in the comments, I also found that it was unrelated to the VRC Player Object.\n\nSo I suspect this is probably not something VRChat can address directly, and it may be fine to close this issue.",
